-
-| Compiler | Time | vs LCCC Phase 5 | vs GCC |
-|----------|------|----------------|--------|
-| LCCC Phase 6 (vectorized) | **~8 ms** | **2.0× faster** | ~2× slower |
-| LCCC Phase 5 (scalar) | 16 ms | baseline | 4× slower |
