-Added to prevent accidental commits:
-```
-# Jekyll
-Gemfile.lock
-
-# Compiled binaries
-*.exe
-a.out
-test_*
-bench_*
-```
-
-**Why:**
-- `Gemfile.lock` is platform-specific and regenerated by bundler
-- Test and benchmark binaries shouldn't be in version control
