-3. **CFG-liveness load/materialize retarget**: `movl SRC,%eax; movl %eax,%REG`
-   → `movl SRC,%REG` when liveness proves %eax dead across the branch edge
-   (phi-move-before-jmp shape, invisible to windowed passes). 32926 → 32735.
