-  `ret_is_f128_sse` and Store/Load `volatile`).
-* Kill switches: `CCC_NO_GADDR_CSE`, `CCC_DISABLE_PASSES=gaddrcse`.
-* Pipeline: after SROA / post-structural-inline, before the main loop.
