-## Harness
-
-```bash
-python3 scripts/aarch64_execute_suite.py \
-  /home/user/src/gcc/gcc/testsuite/gcc.c-torture/execute \
-  --lccc target/fastbuild/lccc-arm \
-  --assembler /tmp/aarch64-as247 \
-  --cross-gcc aarch64-linux-gnu-gcc \
