-# Session 75 (v7) — Agent C patch audit + PF-06 + miscompile fix
-
-Date: 2026-08-24
-Base: `acb61d1` (origin/main after PR #224). Branch `v7-work` builds on top
-of v6 (`1042c64` PF-06 SIB infra) with Agent C's session-75 patch plus v7's
