-
-Date: 2026-08-26
-Upstream base at session start: `510d72d1d861570045072c8f9b9ca06934f8e23e` (lccc main, origin HEAD)
-Compiler build: `scripts/build_lccc_fast.sh` (fastbuild profile, Rust 1.98.0 `-O1`, `-j2`, clang 19 + mold)
