-
-## 1. Environment / reproduction
-
-```text
-Linux Debian 13 (trixie), 2 vCPU, 1.9 GiB RAM, 8 GiB swap (/swapfile)
-Rust 1.98.0 (rustup, minimal + rustfmt/clippy), Cargo 1.98.0
